WEBVTT

00:08.200 --> 00:14.990
-The Mourner's Eyes-

01:31.610 --> 01:35.950
Episode 5

01:37.950 --> 01:39.890
The security in tower A have
not left their positions.

01:39.890 --> 01:41.700
Deal with them as fast as you can.

01:41.700 --> 01:44.060
You have seven minutes to
retrieve the information.

01:58.070 --> 01:59.390
I've entered tower A successfully.

01:59.390 --> 02:02.300
Go to the 21st floor immediately.
The information is there.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.240
Understood.

02:08.450 --> 02:09.680
The game...

02:10.410 --> 02:12.160
has finally begun.

02:12.160 --> 02:14.810
Words engraved on the stone.

02:14.810 --> 02:18.120
Thorns and viscera of years gone.

02:18.120 --> 02:20.220
Be the rain. Be the dust.

02:20.220 --> 02:22.800
Bow down now, before my face.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.140
Show your awe, under my gaze.

02:25.140 --> 02:26.670
For I'm your king.

02:26.670 --> 02:29.000
Your past, your future.

02:29.000 --> 02:34.710
Your ears are for my songs,
and your bones, fingers, pulse

02:34.710 --> 02:36.490
For the king's voice.

02:36.490 --> 02:38.880
My rhythm shall take your life.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.680
Your ashes shall be your pride.

02:41.680 --> 02:43.440
I'm the reason.

02:43.440 --> 02:45.210
I'm the rule.

02:52.060 --> 02:53.650
Not bad.

02:53.650 --> 02:54.830
Let's continue.

02:54.830 --> 02:57.400
I permit you to obey, before my eyes.

02:58.400 --> 02:58.940
What's wrong?

02:58.940 --> 03:01.360
I... can hear a Yanling.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.250
A Yanling?

03:02.250 --> 03:03.620
If I heard correctly,

03:03.620 --> 03:06.450
someone on the other side
is using King's Servant.

03:06.450 --> 03:08.000
King's Servant?!

03:08.000 --> 03:13.180
Our intel didn't mention any hybrids capable
of using Yanling in this security company.

03:13.180 --> 03:15.080
The rank of King's Servant isn't high,

03:15.080 --> 03:18.260
but it can turn a group of
normal people into an army!

03:19.180 --> 03:22.760
Chu Zihang, someone on the other side
can use the King's Servant Yanling,

03:22.760 --> 03:24.990
so don't hold back!

03:24.990 --> 03:26.770
King's Servant...

03:27.920 --> 03:29.140
I understand.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.850
Your ears are for my songs

03:32.850 --> 03:36.210
and your bones, fingers, pulse

03:36.950 --> 03:38.590
For the king's voice.

03:39.330 --> 03:40.990
My rhythm shall take your life.

03:42.290 --> 03:45.640
Your ashes shall be your pride.

03:45.640 --> 03:47.250
I'm the reason.

03:47.750 --> 03:49.350
I'm the rule.

03:49.920 --> 03:52.440
Words engraved on the stone.

03:52.440 --> 03:55.810
Thorns and viscera of years gone.

03:55.810 --> 03:58.130
Be the rain. Be the dust.

04:11.480 --> 04:15.370
This incantation... is the Yanling ranked 29th.

04:15.370 --> 04:16.520
King's Servant.

04:16.960 --> 04:19.170
It causes chosen targets within
the caster's domain

04:19.170 --> 04:22.150
to receive a temporary physical enhancement.

04:22.150 --> 04:26.450
The maximum limit of the enhancement
can reach the limit of the human body.

04:26.940 --> 04:31.580
Why is there someone in the Runde Towers
who can use such a high-level Yanling?

04:32.640 --> 04:35.120
It seems like there's a serious
discrepancy in the intel.

05:16.540 --> 05:18.390
Although it's not fatal,

05:18.390 --> 05:21.300
my attack is enough to paralyze
their bodily functions.

05:21.300 --> 05:24.040
Why... can they still stand up?!

05:38.410 --> 05:39.690
They're not pursuing?

05:43.230 --> 05:45.400
Do they want me on the suspension bridge?

05:45.400 --> 05:47.200
What are they trying to do?

05:49.290 --> 05:51.630
Words engraved on the stone.

05:51.630 --> 05:55.000
Thorns and viscera of years gone.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.210
Be the rain. Be the dust.

05:57.520 --> 05:59.850
Bow down now, before my face.

06:00.330 --> 06:02.170
Show your awe, under my gaze.

06:02.560 --> 06:04.050
For I'm your king.

06:04.050 --> 06:06.550
Your past, your future.

06:06.420 --> 06:08.510
Death Servitors?

06:06.550 --> 06:12.680
Your ears are for my songs,
and your bones, fingers, pulse

06:12.680 --> 06:14.810
For the king's voice.

06:15.080 --> 06:17.630
My rhythm shall take your life.

06:17.630 --> 06:20.000
Your ashes shall be your pride.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.800
I'm the reason.

06:22.110 --> 06:23.530
I'm the rule.

06:44.290 --> 06:45.380
Dad...

07:00.890 --> 07:02.100
What happened?

07:02.760 --> 07:04.880
I don't know! Did something hit the building?!

07:04.880 --> 07:05.730
What the hell?!

07:17.040 --> 07:19.620
The suspension bridge's cables... broke!

07:20.200 --> 07:23.420
So... forcing me onto the
suspension bridge was a trap.

07:23.990 --> 07:25.710
Wanna kill me?

07:29.260 --> 07:30.590
Blood Rage!

07:59.700 --> 08:00.710
Sorry...

08:01.770 --> 08:05.780
I can't let you... waste any more of my time.

08:17.090 --> 08:18.060
The suspension bridge!

08:18.060 --> 08:19.510
The suspension bridge fell!

08:19.510 --> 08:22.100
What happened? Is Chu Zihang okay?

08:22.100 --> 08:23.760
The College hasn't stopped the mission.

08:23.760 --> 08:25.250
Chu Zihang should be fine.

08:25.250 --> 08:26.560
The question now is,

08:26.560 --> 08:28.650
isn't that car ours?

08:28.650 --> 08:30.270
Who was driving it?

08:30.270 --> 08:33.710
I don't know, but I still
have the car keys. How...

08:34.220 --> 08:37.410
Since it's the enemy, shoot!
Destroy the driver!

08:37.410 --> 08:38.180
Then I...

08:38.180 --> 08:38.700
Let me.

08:40.490 --> 08:41.540
Be careful!

08:43.620 --> 08:45.620
There's no one... in the driver's seat?!

08:48.560 --> 08:49.970
No one was driving it?

08:49.970 --> 08:52.510
It... drove here by itself!

08:54.090 --> 08:55.120
It seems...

08:55.890 --> 08:57.680
we're in trouble!

10:27.780 --> 10:31.360
You... Death Servitors...

10:32.010 --> 10:35.460
You... took away my dad...

10:36.840 --> 10:39.280
The effect of Blood Rage
is indeed significant.

10:40.030 --> 10:43.240
With the blessing of King's Servant,

10:42.100 --> 10:43.240
Took away my dad...

10:43.240 --> 10:47.910
you should be able to
enter the illusion soon.

10:49.410 --> 10:52.340
I've waited for six years!

11:03.100 --> 11:04.550
What is the enemy?

11:05.260 --> 11:08.390
Just... cut it open!

12:00.310 --> 12:01.320
You guys...

12:02.240 --> 12:03.770
Why are you here?

12:04.610 --> 12:06.590
You shouldn't be here.

12:07.360 --> 12:12.290
You should be in Nibelungen or Hell.

12:13.300 --> 12:17.880
From the heights of Babylon,
burn into the sun!

12:18.480 --> 12:20.880
Ruler's Flames!

12:26.570 --> 12:28.760
What a happy night.

12:28.760 --> 12:32.270
Thank you, Chu Zihang.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.950
Personnel have lost contact.

12:33.950 --> 12:36.270
Repeat, personnel have lost contact.

12:34.390 --> 12:36.270
Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

12:34.390 --> 12:36.270
What happened?! Where's the image?!

12:36.270 --> 12:37.790
What the hell happened?

12:37.790 --> 12:39.440
It's all because of that driverless car.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.940
Damn it!

12:41.350 --> 12:43.490
Where is Chu Zihang? Where is Chu Zihang?

12:43.490 --> 12:46.320
First floor strike team,
withdraw immediately!

12:46.320 --> 12:49.280
Orders received. Everyone, withdraw
from the Runde Towers immediately!

12:49.280 --> 12:49.870
Yes, sir!

12:49.870 --> 12:51.440
Mission aborted!

12:51.440 --> 12:53.910
No, the mission continues.

12:54.400 --> 12:56.780
I know where Chu Zihang is.

12:56.780 --> 12:57.830
Norma.

12:57.830 --> 13:00.610
Identifying the source
of Chu Zihang's signal.

13:01.050 --> 13:02.260
That's...

13:02.680 --> 13:05.090
Chu Zihang is fine.

13:05.090 --> 13:06.940
He's on the 21st floor.

13:08.060 --> 13:09.360
Thank God.

13:09.360 --> 13:10.750
What is he doing?

13:10.750 --> 13:12.060
I don't know.

13:12.060 --> 13:14.450
But he has never let me down.

13:14.450 --> 13:17.370
He will bring back what we need.

13:17.370 --> 13:18.960
We have over two minutes left.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.270
There's still time.

13:20.270 --> 13:21.780
Two minutes?

13:21.780 --> 13:25.500
He should be coming down the
elevator with the information already!

13:25.500 --> 13:27.500
The entire plan is off schedule!

13:27.500 --> 13:29.410
Order your students to withdraw immediately!

13:29.410 --> 13:30.930
Don't worry.

13:30.930 --> 13:32.850
He will complete the mission,

13:32.850 --> 13:35.370
and retrieve the information by himself.

13:37.670 --> 13:38.800
What is this?

13:38.800 --> 13:42.130
This is the real version of
his previous mission report.

13:42.450 --> 13:46.320
I polished up the one you found in Norma.

13:50.720 --> 13:52.950
Now you understand, right?

13:52.950 --> 13:55.930
The current situation
isn't difficult for him.

13:55.930 --> 13:59.600
I just hope he doesn't make
things too complicated.

14:00.830 --> 14:05.320
Do... Do you know what your student is?

14:05.320 --> 14:08.720
I don't know, but he is very useful.

14:08.720 --> 14:10.530
But you don't trust him,

14:10.880 --> 14:13.650
so you planted a tracking device on him.

14:13.650 --> 14:15.180
Does he know?

14:15.180 --> 14:16.720
He doesn't know.

14:16.720 --> 14:19.220
It's not a matter of trust.

14:19.220 --> 14:21.680
It's like having a sharp knife.

14:21.680 --> 14:24.010
You always keep an eye on it

14:24.010 --> 14:27.470
to avoid accidentally hurting someone.

14:27.880 --> 14:31.090
Where is Chu Zihang's tracking device?

14:31.090 --> 14:33.840
He had a tooth filled at
the College infirmary,

14:33.840 --> 14:37.980
and the tracking device was implanted
in his wisdom tooth at that time.

14:37.980 --> 14:40.370
It was covered with a titanium crown,

14:40.370 --> 14:42.320
so it doesn't show up on X-rays.

14:43.500 --> 14:47.190
Huh? Even someone with such an
excellent bloodline gets cavities?

14:47.190 --> 14:51.900
I actually felt a little relieved
when I found out he had a cavity.

14:52.770 --> 14:54.170
Don't worry.

14:54.170 --> 14:56.880
He'll complete the mission soon,

14:56.880 --> 14:59.600
and bring back what we need.

15:18.680 --> 15:20.450
There's someone...

15:21.200 --> 15:22.630
up there...

15:23.740 --> 15:24.860
I need to...

15:26.500 --> 15:28.390
go up.

15:35.440 --> 15:37.190
Come, you bastard!

15:37.190 --> 15:39.700
There's only one entrance to this safehouse.

15:39.700 --> 15:41.460
It's this elevator!

15:41.460 --> 15:42.830
Come, come!

15:42.830 --> 15:44.880
I have you in my sights!

15:44.880 --> 15:47.440
I don't care who you are. I'm not afraid!

15:47.440 --> 15:50.380
Even the most powerful person
will be killed by bullets.

15:50.380 --> 15:52.630
I have a gun, so who am I afraid of?

16:00.730 --> 16:03.350
He exploded up... from beneath the floor!

16:03.350 --> 16:07.690
Bastard! Bastard!
Die, die, die, die, die!

16:14.600 --> 16:15.850
Die...

16:16.570 --> 16:17.530
Everyone...

16:19.200 --> 16:20.200
must die.

16:24.950 --> 16:25.830
Brother...

16:25.830 --> 16:28.040
Chu Zihang

16:26.190 --> 16:28.040
Answer the phone, Brother.

16:29.360 --> 16:32.090
Please, please don't get into any trouble.

16:32.540 --> 16:33.300
I'll be there soon.

16:59.160 --> 17:01.620
Brother... Brother, Brother!

17:03.770 --> 17:07.180
Lu Mingfei.

17:09.250 --> 17:11.760
Brother, Brother, Brother!

17:11.760 --> 17:14.040
Answer the phone, Brother!

17:14.610 --> 17:15.680
Brother!

17:24.230 --> 17:27.280
Am I... being controlled?

17:28.340 --> 17:30.060
By King's Servant...

17:32.380 --> 17:33.730
Don't... Don't kill me.

17:33.730 --> 17:35.940
No, no, no... Don't... Don't...

17:36.530 --> 17:39.190
Is that... your father?

17:42.070 --> 17:44.540
Yes, yes! That is my father!

17:44.540 --> 17:46.460
My... My father!

17:47.110 --> 17:48.500
Treat him well.

17:51.350 --> 17:53.020
I don't have much time.

17:53.020 --> 17:55.090
You took something you shouldn't have taken.

17:55.090 --> 17:58.300
I... I know. It's on the sofa!

17:59.190 --> 18:00.260
Did you open it?

18:00.820 --> 18:01.810
I wouldn't dare!

18:01.810 --> 18:04.020
We wouldn't dare look at
our clients' private files.

18:04.020 --> 18:05.640
It was meant to be sent out tonight,

18:05.640 --> 18:08.890
but you came, so...

18:14.280 --> 18:17.220
Sorry for causing you financial loss.

18:17.220 --> 18:18.860
I-It's okay.

18:20.370 --> 18:23.900
Could it be... Is he the courier?

18:26.040 --> 18:28.820
Dad, I'll be home for dinner tonight.

18:28.820 --> 18:30.630
Leave me something hot.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.110
Mission accomplished.

18:35.110 --> 18:36.710
You were right.

18:36.710 --> 18:40.000
Chu Zihang was fully capable of
completing the mission by himself.

18:40.000 --> 18:43.310
But at the same time,
he cannot work with others.

18:43.310 --> 18:45.890
His bloodline is too strong.

18:45.890 --> 18:48.710
In pursuit of the strongest students,

18:48.710 --> 18:51.500
only the strongest are acceptable.

18:51.500 --> 18:54.270
The rest are not.

18:54.270 --> 18:58.030
But because he is the strongest,
he has once again encountered problems.

18:58.790 --> 19:00.910
One minute and 50 seconds into the mission,

19:00.910 --> 19:03.570
he completely deviated
from the plan as outlined.

19:03.570 --> 19:07.200
We have no idea what he did during
those three minutes and 10 seconds.

19:07.200 --> 19:10.310
Also, he caused a significant
amount of damage.

19:10.310 --> 19:13.630
Cleaning up after this
incident will not be easy.

19:15.900 --> 19:17.000
Yes.

19:17.780 --> 19:19.600
According to the mission report,

19:19.600 --> 19:24.010
he might have been on the verge
of losing control this time.

19:33.480 --> 19:36.070
I can pretend not to know,

19:36.480 --> 19:38.940
but you must find a way to handle it.

19:41.220 --> 19:46.690
Sometimes, I'd rather he was like
Lu Mingfei, with no special abilities.

19:46.690 --> 19:48.080
Nonsense!

19:48.080 --> 19:51.040
Mingfei is full of inspiration.

19:51.040 --> 19:56.670
Oh? Then tell me, what was your
valued disciple doing during the mission?

19:56.670 --> 19:58.430
Uh... He... He...

19:58.430 --> 20:01.820
During the mission, he was
on a date with a girl.

20:01.820 --> 20:02.480
Huh?

20:02.480 --> 20:04.430
But he left quickly,

20:04.430 --> 20:07.450
and is now heading to the scene

20:07.450 --> 20:09.610
to meet up with Chu Zihang.

20:12.980 --> 20:15.970
Uh-oh, it seems like he was disturbed.

20:15.970 --> 20:20.010
Otherwise, Chu Zihang, who lost control,
would definitely have destroyed this block.

20:25.950 --> 20:26.820
Oh, well.

20:27.430 --> 20:30.330
I got you to use Blood Rage,
so it wasn't in vain.

20:31.940 --> 20:34.490
I'm looking forward to
meeting properly next time.

20:56.730 --> 20:57.700
Brother!

20:58.150 --> 20:59.050
Brother!

21:03.650 --> 21:04.550
Brother!

21:05.640 --> 21:07.930
H-How did you get injured like this?

21:11.260 --> 21:12.330
Mingfei...

21:13.350 --> 21:15.350
Brother. Brother, you...

21:16.320 --> 21:18.630
How did you get injured like this, Brother?

21:19.440 --> 21:21.340
I... I... I...

21:23.550 --> 21:24.510
Brother! Bro—

21:26.840 --> 21:27.980
I'm fine.

21:29.490 --> 21:31.600
Just let me lean on your
shoulder for a bit.

21:33.820 --> 21:36.770
Thank you, Lu Mingfei.

21:39.680 --> 21:40.910
Brother...

21:42.950 --> 21:44.320
It was you...

21:45.150 --> 21:46.680
who made the rain...

21:47.710 --> 21:48.990
stop.

21:51.220 --> 21:52.420
Thanks.
